# The launcher (Super+Space, as on Omarchy): typing narrows the list,
# Enter starts the chosen program and the launcher closes.
@ai
$ ai control on
@ctl keys {machine} "{super+space}"
$ sleep 1
$ threads
~ launcher +(waiting|ready|running)
@ctl text {machine}
~ --- window \d+: Start ---
~ Terminal +a shell in a window
@ctl keys {machine} "mon"
@ctl text {machine}
~ Start: mon
~ Monitor +processors, memory
@ctl keys {machine} "{enter}"
$ sleep 1
$ threads
~ monitor +(waiting|ready|running)
!~ launcher
